@title Crane in 3D: the yellow floor line is explained as a drawn marking
@area Simulate
@sizes 1920x1080
# The "?" of the Hoist in 3D window says the yellow floor line is a drawn marking, not a computed clearance.
open qa/fixtures/travel-drive.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 120
click 1820 103
wait 20
expect "drawn marking, not a computed safety clearance"
shot floor-line-help
key Escape
check_layout
